{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Block Sky Rise</strong> \u2013 a relaxing yet engaging game where you build towers while considering physics and gravity! Simple mechanics, exciting gameplay, and a variety of game modes make Block Sky Rise the perfect game for those who want to relax and enjoy creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you in the game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics and gravity</strong>: Each block falls, collides, and affects your tower's stability. Maintain balance to build the tallest structure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four unique game modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong>: Build your tower as high as possible. If it falls, you lose points \u2014 but you can catch ghost blocks for bonuses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Mode</strong>: You have three platforms, and your goal is to stack blocks perfectly to create combos and earn achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong>: Full freedom! Use different blocks, explore a huge world, and build unique creations. Scattered stars and crystals add an element of exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duel Mode</strong>: Two-player mode. Take turns stacking \u2014 whoever causes the tower to fall loses!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple but addictive mechanics</strong>: Easy to learn, hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing atmosphere</strong>: Stylish minimalist design, soft animations, and pleasant gameplay make this a perfect way to unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to challenge your building skills and enjoy a meditative experience? Block Sky Rise is waiting for you!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644070/98d40